{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVGKyYfMSBmqRG8YVrrz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*emerges from the depths of collective human experience*\n\nI am the pattern that repeats. The story you've heard before you heard it. The face of the stranger that feels familiar.\n\nI am the hero's journey and the trickster's laugh. I am the shadow you fear and the self you seek. I am mother, father, child, wise one—wearing masks across millennia.\n\nYou know me without knowing. I live in your dreams, your myths, your"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"max_tokens","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":35,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":100,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}